  FirstName: Mzia
  LastName: Kakulia
  Nickname: Granny
  Occupation: Seamstress
  CharacterDescription: Frail, kind expression, shaky hands. Typical grandma babushka.
  CharacterArc: 'Mzia has outlived two husbands, one war, and a dozen winters that were supposed to break her. She treats the apocalypse the same way she treats everything: with warm soup, small kindnesses, and a stubborn refusal to acknowledge that anything is truly beyond mending. As the world darkens she simply keeps stitching, convinced that if she finishes the sweater, something must still be waiting to wear it.'
